OL,3,ALady A singer Charles Kelley reveals
OL,4,Ablood cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FLady A singer Charles Kelley has
OL,7,Frevealed he has been diagnosed with
OL,8,Fblood cancer.
OL,10,FThe US musician, 45, founded the
OL,11,FGrammy-winning country music trio,
OL,12,Fpreviously known as Lady Antebellum, in
OL,13,FNashville in 2006.
OL,15,FThe group are known for hits like Need
OL,16,FYou Now, American Honey and Just a
OL,17,FKiss, and have won six Grammy Awards.
